| F5 | `LOG.md` §Round 82 `Frontier: registry 302 → 305 rows` | `log82-frontier-rows=305` | `corpus/SOURCES.md` at the declared population revision `b1ba614b` → **305** rows (holds; the tip adds this round's own rows and must not move the witness) |
