## Axis and verdict rules

C1 operability 8 → 8 (the late-acceptance instrument gains the on-disk path binding and a pending-fall
leg; the score holds because the class is already held). C2 calibration 7 → 7 (three stale facts of the
round-82 record repaired value-bound, three proved holding; the score holds). C3 freshness 8 → 8 (four
relation rows gain graded rechecks; the score holds). No axis is claimed to move in score; each move is
measured on its line. No axis may be harmed: no change to depth/coverage/adjacency claims, and every
edit to an append-only file is an append.

